# Only used by `vercel deploy` from a working tree (Git deployments clone the repository). Without it the CLI would
# upload local secrets and databases: it does not read `.gitignore`.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/data
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/node_modules
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
e2e/.run
packages/recovery-tool/dist
apps/vault/dist
apps/vault/.brand-build-*
.claude
**/.impeccable
